OL,3,GNEWSATV singing contest winner admits
OL,4,Aillegal dog breeding
OL,5,
OL,6,FA TV singing competition winner has
OL,7,Fadmitted to being involved in illegal
OL,8,Fdog breeding and fraud.
OL,10,FSara Pritchard Davies, a previous
OL,11,Fwinner of S4C's Can i Gymru singing
OL,12,Fcontest, admitted knowingly taking part
OL,13,Fin a fraudulent business between March
OL,14,F2015 and November 2023.
OL,16,FThe 29-year-old pleaded guilty to one
OL,17,Fcharge of being involved in a
OL,18,Ffraudulent business relating to illegal
OL,19,Fdog breeding and another of acquiring
OL,20,F#33,629 from criminal conduct.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
